## Output Format

Return ONLY valid JSON matching the required schema (`score`, `evidence`,
`justification`).

- Do not include any text before or after the JSON
- Do not rename or add fields
- `score` is an integer 0–4
- `evidence` must be verbatim quote(s) carried over from the excerpt
  evaluations above (which are themselves verbatim from the transcript), or
  the literal string `"No relevant utterance"` when no excerpt observed the
  behavior
- `justification` is a short explanation (one or two sentences) of why the
  evidence warrants this score under the anchors above
